      "writtenOn": "2025-06-16T17:56:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree. This _should_ result in the PDC reducing current draw to ~500 mA for ~500 ms. If it doesn\u0027t, that\u0027s probably a PD compliance bug on the part of the PDC.\n\nNote that this spec requirement on PDC behavior only applies for voltage transitions. The PDC _may_ legally renegotiate from 5V/3A to 5V/5A without dropping current draw, if that\u0027s an option. Whether the PDC actually does this probably depends on the PDC.",
